{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38328","headline":"赋雪 · 吴融","name":"赋雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一夜阴风度，平明颢气交。\n未知融结判，唯见混茫包。\n路莫藏行迹，林难出树梢。\n气应封兽穴，险必堕禽巢。\n影密灯回照，声繁竹送敲。\n翫宜苏让点，飡称蜜匀抄。\n结冻防鱼跃，黏沙费马跑。\n炉寒资爇荻，屋暖赖编茅。\n远不分山叠，低宜失地坳。\n阑干高百尺，新霁若爲抛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}